# Phone + national ID uniqueness + daily cap (no OTP)

**PRD:** `md files/prd-phone-uniqueness-daily-cap.md`

## Policy

- One submission ever per normalized Lebanese phone and per normalized national_id.
- **Public form always open** (daily cap removed 2026-06-09). Admin batches: 50/day Beirut FIFO by `queue_number` — see `agent-onboarding.md`.
- No OTP. No device/IP uniqueness.

## Before editing

1. Read PRD file spec for this path.
2. Grill user on open questions.
3. Implement only after confirmation.
